    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53568" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρχᾰρ-όδους</span></b> , ὁ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ</span> (neut. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
