					Plot.
					6.7.9
				</span></i>
			), gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όδοντος</span>, <i>with
				saw-like teeth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρχαρόδοντε δύω κύνε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
